    "preview": {
      "id": "preview-en-v1",
      "text": "Good morning, I hope your day is starting off well. The porch light is off, and your fifteen-minute timer is set."
    },
    "full": {
      "id": "main-en-v1",
      "text": "Good morning, I hope your day is starting off well. It’s 7:15 on Tuesday, and the kitchen is 68 degrees. Your first appointment is with Dr. Patel at 9:30. Before you leave, put the blue folder beside the front door and check that the back gate is closed. The shopping list has fresh fish, six crisp apples, coffee, and a small box of matches. The total is $23.50. Did you say fifteen minutes, or fifty? I’ve set a timer for fifteen minutes. The porch light is off, but the hall light is still on. If the washing machine finishes while you’re upstairs, I’ll let you know. Please bring the spare key to Rachel’s desk. Everything else looks quiet. I’m ready when you are, and I promise to keep the commentary brief."
    }
  },
